<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    1129    714    4240    59</p>
<p> Great Lakes    24131   9738   14093    29</p>
<p> River Points   14096  26866   25612    39</p>
<p> Southwest	11512   9096     619    19</p>
<p> Gulf Points    12593   5252    7737    32</p>
<p> Plains Area    31877  29419    3599    42</p>
<p> Pacific NW     10283   2012     unq    40</p>
<p> Grand Total   105621  83097   55900    34</p>
